<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for Oct 21-27 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		     Oct 21-27   Oct 23-29	  TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    414,605.8   256,063.3</p>
<p> Production	42,209.2    44,002.0     633,024.9  433,707.0  Shipment	  20,318.3     3,373.0     361,304.1  284,535.4  Home Market	  310.1	 450.0	 4,982.0    6,979.3  Stocks/close   436,186.6   296,242.4</p>
<p>--Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
